zlib
----

The plugin decompresses gzip-compressed captures with zlib 1.3.1
(https://zlib.net), which the build fetches and links in statically.  Its
source is the release archive

    https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/download/v1.3.1/zlib-1.3.1.tar.gz
