Third-party component: Mbed TLS
-------------------------------

The plugin's library contains parts of Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (its AES, GCM,
ChaCha20-Poly1305, SHA-1/SHA-2, HMAC and HKDF code), which the build
fetches from its release (CMakeLists.txt) and links in statically, for the
TLS decryption.  Mbed TLS is dual-licensed under the Apache License 2.0 or
the GNU General Public License version 2 or later; this plugin takes it
under the GPL-2.0-or-later, which combines with its own GPL-3.0-or-later.
Its source, with its full license texts, is the release archive

    https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/download/mbedtls-3.6.7/mbedtls-3.6.7.tar.bz2
    SHA-256 a7e8bcbec0e6f761b4af24f25677626b35f762f68eef79c08677a363212d11f6

built with the configuration third_party/mbedtls_config.h of this plugin.

    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later
    Copyright The Mbed TLS Contributors

Corresponding source
--------------------

A release package of the plugin (logsquirl-tcpdump-<version>-<platform>.zip)
carries this NOTICE and LICENSE.  Its corresponding source is the plugin's
source at the release's tag, v<version>, at
https://github.com/64x-lunicorn/LogSquirl-tcpdump (also the "Source code"
archives of the release there), with the build scripts that fetch and
build zlib and Mbed TLS, and the two archives above, which the build checks
by their SHA-256.  Should either archive no longer be available at its
address, ask for it in the plugin's issue tracker, and it will be provided
for as long as that release is distributed.
